{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793872942139,"sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","part":{"partID":"prt_1ab28c8c9002KpO1U7D0KBnwMS","sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","messageID":"msg_1ab28c006001nHqrX0UfHV9YzW","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8b41f4c83a8a2071","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals && grep -rn --exclude-dir=node_modules --exclude-dir=.git --exclude-dir=lineages -i \"fundamentals\" .skilled .claude .codex .hermes .pi .opencode README.md 2>/dev/null | grep -v \"specs/\" | head -60"},"output":".skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.1.0.md:50:- **Design values have one owner.** A visual value that a request or a frame leaves open goes to `sk-design-fundamentals`, which now ranks a project profile last and honours reduced motion on web and native.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.1.0.md:117:#### Open Design Values Go to `sk-design-fundamentals`\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.1.0.md:119:A Figma read that feeds code ends at that check. When a request or a frame leaves a visual value open, or a value sits off every token and scale, `sk-design-fundamentals` decides it, and `sk-code` hands the same question there instead of inventing a value. A built screen and its frame then answer to one owner.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.0.md:50:- **Design has one hub.** `sk-design` routes fundamentals, measured `DESIGN.md` extraction, charts and diagrams to the mode that owns the job.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.0.md:334:- **`sk-design-fundamentals`**, the default. It designs, builds and reviews any laid-out surface from fixed value scales: spacing, type, colour, contrast and hierarchy. That used to mean screen UI only. It now covers slide decks, printed pages and document layouts too, and adds interaction guidelines, motion principles and a WCAG review pass where the surface is a screen. It routes by alias and carries no command of its own.\n.skilled/logs/codex-hooks-watchdog.log:1:2026-11-05T08:30:37.173Z codex hook drift detected; run: node /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals/.skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs --check\n.skilled/logs/codex-hooks-watchdog.log:2:2026-11-05T08:36:11.051Z codex hook drift detected; run: node /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals/.skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs --check\n.skilled/logs/codex-hooks-watchdog.log:3:2026-11-05T08:40:29.955Z codex hook drift detected; run: node /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals/.skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs --check\n.skilled/logs/codex-hooks-watchdog.log:4:2026-11-05T09:01:37.648Z codex hook drift detected; run: node /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals/.skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs --check\n.skilled/logs/codex-hooks-watchdog.log:5:2026-11-05T09:08:16.610Z codex hook drift detected; run: node /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals/.skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs --check\n.skilled/logs/codex-hooks-watchdog.log:6:2026-11-05T09:15:01.289Z codex hook drift detected; run: node /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals/.skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs --check\n.skilled/logs/codex-hooks-watchdog.log:7:2026-11-05T10:01:31.317Z codex hook drift detected; run: node /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals/.skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs --check\n.skilled/skills/sk-prompt/SKILL.md:184:- [format-guide-markdown.md](./assets/format-guide-markdown.md) - Markdown format deep-dive: fundamentals, delivery standards, RCAF/CRAFT structures, advanced patterns, validation, best practices\n.skilled/skills/sk-prompt/SKILL.md:185:- [format-guide-json.md](./assets/format-guide-json.md) - JSON format deep-dive: fundamentals, data types, delivery standards, RCAF/CRAFT structures, advanced patterns, validation, best practices\n.skilled/skills/sk-prompt/SKILL.md:186:- [format-guide-yaml.md](./assets/format-guide-yaml.md) - YAML format deep-dive: fundamentals, data types, delivery standards, RCAF/CRAFT structures, advanced patterns, templates, validation, best practices\n.skilled/skills/sk-prompt/assets/format-guide-markdown.md:3:description: Deep-dive formatting guide for Markdown prompt output, the default human-readable mode, covering fundamentals, delivery standards, RCAF/CRAFT structures, syntax validation, and best practices.\n.skilled/skills/sk-prompt/assets/format-guide-markdown.md:37:## 2. FUNDAMENTALS\n.skilled/skills/sk-prompt/assets/format-guide-json.md:3:description: Deep-dive formatting guide for JSON prompt output covering fundamentals, data types, delivery standards, RCAF/CRAFT structures, advanced patterns, syntax validation, and best practices.\n.skilled/skills/sk-prompt/assets/format-guide-json.md:37:## 2. FUNDAMENTALS\n.skilled/skills/sk-prompt/assets/format-guide-yaml.md:3:description: Deep-dive formatting guide for YAML prompt output covering fundamentals, data types, delivery standards, RCAF/CRAFT structures, anchor-based templates, syntax validation, and best practices.\n.skilled/skills/sk-prompt/assets/format-guide-yaml.md:37:## 2. FUNDAMENTALS\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/fixtures/phrase-variants.json:38099:    \"deprecate fundamentals phase parent spec\": [\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/fixtures/phrase-variants.json:38100:      \"deprecate fundamentals phase parent spec\"\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/fixtures/phrase-variants.json:50595:    \"fundamentals beyond ui\": [\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/fixtures/phrase-variants.json:50596:      \"fundamentals beyond ui\"\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/fixtures/phrase-variants.json:50598:    \"fundamentals beyond ui acceptance criteria\": [\n.ski