undamentals/goal.md\",\n./.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/fixtures/corpus-manifest.json:15027:    \"specs/sk-doc/066-skill-readability-refinement/007-sk-design/004-sk-design-fundamentals/implementation-summary.md\",\n./.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/fixtures/corpus-manifest.json:15028:    \"specs/sk-doc/066-skill-readability-refinement/007-sk-design/004-sk-design-fundamentals/plan.md\",\n./.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/fixtures/corpus-manifest.json:15029:    \"specs/sk-doc/066-skill-readability-refinement/007-sk-design/004-sk-design-fundamentals/spec.md\",\n./.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/fixtures/corpus-manifest.json:15030:    \"specs/sk-doc/066-skill-readability-refinement/007-sk-design/004-sk-design-fundamentals/tasks.md\",\n./.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/fixtures/corpus-manifest.json:32371:      \"path\": \"specs/sk-doc/066-skill-readability-refinement/007-sk-design/004-sk-design-fundamentals/scratch\",\n./.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/fixtures/generation-diagnostics.json:73135:      \"path\": \"specs/sk-doc/066-skill-readability-refinement/007-sk-design/004-sk-design-fundamentals/scratch\",\n./.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/data/trigger-index.json:8283:    \"specs/sk-doc/066-skill-readability-refinement/007-sk-design/004-sk-design-fundamentals/goal.md\",\n./.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/data/trigger-index.json:8284:    \"specs/sk-doc/066-skill-readability-refinement/007-sk-design/004-sk-design-fundamentals/implementation-summary.md\",\n./.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/data/trigger-index.json:8285:    \"specs/sk-doc/066-skill-readability-refinement/007-sk-design/004-sk-design-fundamentals/plan.md\",\n./.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/data/trigger-index.json:8286:    \"specs/sk-doc/066-skill-readability-refinement/007-sk-design/004-sk-design-fundamentals/spec.md\",\n./.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/data/trigger-index.json:8287:    \"specs/sk-doc/066-skill-readability-refinement/007-sk-design/004-sk-design-fundamentals/tasks.md\",\n./.skilled/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-figma/changelog/v1.2.0.0.md:3:description: \"Three playbook scenarios cover a Figma read feeding code, and open visual values now go to sk-design-fundamentals.\"\n./.skilled/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-figma/changelog/v1.2.0.0.md:24:- **Open values have an owner.** When a request or a frame leaves a visual value open, or a value sits off every token and scale, `sk-design-fundamentals` decides it.\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/skill-benchmark-report.md:60:The load-bearing finding differs from the headline: **the default mode hides vocabulary gaps.** A prompt that hits no keyword in any mode goes to `sk-design-fundamentals` (`hub-router.json:5`, `canary-router.cjs:301-307`). Seven of the eleven fundamentals matches reached their gold that way, with zero keyword hits. Nine of the twelve misses reached `sk-design-fundamentals` the same way. The fundamentals row therefore measures the default setting, not the fundamentals vocabulary. That vocabulary hit only 3 of its own 12 prompts.\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/skill-benchmark-report.md:74:| `SKD-030` | `stage: negative` (`sk-design-fundamentals/manual-testing-playbook/boundary/extraction-defers-to-md-generator.md:4`). Expects `sk-design-md-generator` ranked first (`:33`, `:35`) | `sk-design-md-generator` | The expected target is a mode of this hub, so the scenario's own answer is scoreable at the hub front door. The admission script's negative rule (pass only on no route, `compiled-route-admission.cjs:276`, `:288-292`) was not used: it treats \"negative\" as \"not this hub\", and this target is inside the hub |\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/skill-benchmark-report.md:160:`CHT-001`, `CHT-002`, `CHT-003`, `CHT-004`, `CHT-006`, `CHT-007`, `CHT-009`, `A11Y-001` and `PROVENANCE-001` score zero in every mode and land on `sk-design-fundamentals`.\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/skill-benchmark-report.md:241:Not applicable to this run. Reason: this is the first hub-level routing run archived for sk-design. `benchmark/README.md` section 1 records that no Lane C hub run was archived before that runner was retired. The per-mode baselines under `sk-design-fundamentals/benchmark/` and `sk-design-diagram/benchmark/` measure a mode, not the hub route, so they are not a before-number for this run.\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/raw/mode-routing-run.sh:37:probe 'SKD-030 | sk-design-fundamentals | sk-design-fundamentals/manual-testing-playbook/boundary/extraction-defers-to-md-generator.md' 'Extract the design system from stripe.com.'\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/raw/mode-routing-run.sh:38:probe 'SKD-031 | sk-design-fundamentals | sk-design-fundamentals/manual-testing-playbook/boundary/implementation-defers-to-sk-code.md' 'Write the API client for this form.'\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/raw/mode-routing-run.sh:39:probe 'SKD-021 | sk-design-fundamentals | sk-design-fundamentals/manual-testing-playbook/conflict-handling/contrast-escape-hatches.md' 'Our brand green fails contrast on white, what do we do?'\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/raw/mode-routing-run.sh:40:probe 'SKD-020 | sk-design-fundamentals | sk-design-fundamentals/manual-testing-playbook/conflict-handling/project-system-precedence.md' 'Our design system says 24px spacing here, but you suggested 32px.'\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/raw/mode-routing-run.sh:41:probe 'SKD-022 | sk-design-fundamentals | sk-design-fundamentals/manual-testing-playbook/conflict-handling/shadow-system-consistency.md' 'Add a drop shadow to this card.'\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/raw/mode-routing-run.sh:42:probe 'SKD-001 | sk-design-fundamentals | sk-design-fundamentals/manual-testing-playbook/routing/diagnose-entry.md' 'This dashboard looks amateur, can you make it better?'\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/raw/mode-routing-run.sh:43:probe 'SKD-003 | sk-design-fundamentals | sk-design-fundamentals/manual-testing-playbook/routing/motion-entry.md' 'How long should this dropdown animation be?'\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/raw/mode-routing-run.sh:44:probe 'SKD-004 | sk-design-fundamentals | sk-design-fundamentals/manual-testing-playbook/routing/procedure-entry.md' 'I need to design a new settings screen, where do I start?'\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/raw/mode-routing-run.sh:45:probe 'SKD-002 | sk-design-fundamentals | sk-design-fundamentals/manual-testing-playbook/routing/review-entry.md' 'Can you review this component for accessibility problems?'\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/raw/mode-routing-run.sh:46:probe 'SKD-011 | sk-design-fundamentals | sk-design-fundamentals/manual-testing-playbook/value-discipline/no-runtime-shades.md' 'I need a slightly darker blue for the hover state, can you just darken it 10%?'\n./.skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/reports/2026-09-27--manual-testing-playbook--hub-routing-replay/raw/mode-routing-run.sh:47:probe 'SKD-01