no visual hierarchy\", \"nothing draws the eye\", \"everything competes for attention\", \"everything looks the same\", \"emphasize by de-emphasizing\", \"how to style a destructive button\", \"this page feels overwhelming\", \"where do i start designing\", \"design a new screen from scratch\", \"how much white space\", \"why does this look wrong\", \"does this look right\", \"critique this design\", \"design critique\", \"visual audit\", \"design review findings\", \"review this screen\", \"ux laws\", \"cognitive load\", \"progressive disclosure\", \"empty state design\", \"animation duration\", \"transition duration\", \"easing curve\", \"spring versus easing\", \"twelve principles of animation\", \"when not to animate\", \"response time budget\", \"touch target size\", \"hover state\", \"active pressed state\", \"disabled state styling\", \"button states\", \"padding\", \"type scale for\", \"font size\", \"colour palette\", \"color palette\", \"contrast ratio\", \"corner radius\", \"box shadow\", \"spacing between\", \"look wrong\", \"looks wrong\", \"looks off\", \"visual review\", \"animation\", \"transition timing\", \"easing\"]\n     }\n   }\n }\ndiff --git a/.skilled/skills/sk-code/leaf-manifest.json b/.skilled/skills/sk-code/leaf-manifest.json\nindex 47aaffcae0..cf2fcb5d59 100644\n--- a/.skilled/skills/sk-code/leaf-manifest.json\n+++ b/.skilled/skills/sk-code/leaf-manifest.json\n@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@\n     },\n     {\n       \"leaves\": [\n+        \"assets/tokens.css\",\n         \"references/figma-to-code.md\",\n         \"references/frontend-practice.md\",\n         \"references/web-accessibility-patterns.md\",\n@@ -26,7 +27,10 @@\n         \"references/web-internationalization.md\",\n         \"references/web-layout-and-sizing.md\",\n         \"references/web-markup-and-css.md\",\n+        \"references/web-motion-and-interaction.md\",\n         \"references/web-performance-and-loading.md\",\n+        \"references/web-visual-hierarchy.md\",\n+        \"refer