p), `mcp-code-mode` (the optional MCP transport), `mcp-chrome-devtools` (browser preview only), and `system-spec-kit` when packet documentation or memory continuity applies. When a request or a frame leaves a visual value open (spacing, type, color, radius, shadow or motion), or a value sits off every token and scale, load `sk-design-fundamentals` and decide it there.\n+Related skills: `sk-design-md-generator` (a measured Style Reference of extracted design tokens, applied whenever a read/export feeds a decision), `sk-code` (adapting exports into an app), `mcp-code-mode` (the optional MCP transport), `mcp-chrome-devtools` (browser preview only), and `system-spec-kit` when packet documentation or memory continuity applies. When a request or a frame leaves a visual value open (spacing, type, color, radius, shadow or motion), or a value sits off every token and scale, load `sk-code-frontend` (`web-visual-values.md`) and decide it there.\n \n A Figma read that feeds code ends at the five-pass check in `.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/figma-to-code.md`.\n \ndiff --git a/.hermes/skills/sk-code/ROUTER.md b/.hermes/skills/sk-code/ROUTER.md\nindex 9cc3571340..99c436f0f5 100644\n--- a/.hermes/skills/sk-code/ROUTER.md\n+++ b/.hermes/skills/sk-code/ROUTER.md\n@@ -251,9 +251,12 @@ INTENT_SIGNALS = {\n     \"WEB_ELEMENTS\":        {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"html form autocomplete\", \"dialog element\", \"popover attribute\"]},\n     \"WEB_CASCADE\":         {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"css cascade layers\", \"css specificity conflict\"]},\n     \"WEB_LAYOUT\":          {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"container query layout\", \"css stacking context\"]},\n-    \"WEB_A11Y\":            {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"web accessibility pattern\", \"focus visible styling\", \"keyboard focus\", \"broken tab order\", \"accessible name\", \"aria live region\"]},\n+    \"WEB_A11Y\":            {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"web accessibility pattern\", \