{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793873187830,"sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","part":{"partID":"prt_1ab2c935c002Ury54QrMFIBGWW","sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","messageID":"msg_1ab2c8c7c001LrngrKUd2isQVN","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a1516e1edf80b93b","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals && grep -E \"^### V[0-9]+\\.\" .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-visual-values.md"},"output":"### V1. Spacing and sizing scale\n### V2. Opacity set\n### V3. Space around a group exceeds space within it\n### V4. Motion duration bands\n### V5. Type scale and units\n### V6. Font weight\n### V7. Line-height and line length\n### V8. Baseline alignment and letter-spacing\n### V9. Line breaking and font synthesis\n### V10. Numerals and typeface selection\n### V11. Personality is four decisions\n### V12. Ramp counts and naming\n### V13. HSL and no runtime shades\n### V14. Build the ramp from 500 outward\n### V15. Saturation rises at the ends\n### V16. Perceived brightness and hue rotation\n### V17. Warm and cool greys\n### V18. Contrast ratios and the two escape hatches\n### V19. Dark mode\n### V20. Five shadow elevations\n### V21. One light source for raised and inset\n### V22. Raised and inset treatments\n### V23. Two-part cast and contact shadows\n### V24. Layered three-part set and pick one\n### V25. Shadow colour\n### V26. Button anatomy\n### V27. Depth without shadows\n### V28. Border radius and concentric radius\n### V29. Semi-transparent borders\n### V30. Grids and fixed sizing\n### V31. Component shape\n### V32. Text over photos\n### V33. Intended size for icons and screenshots\n### V34. User-uploaded content and photography\n### V35. Reference roles, not raw ramps\n### V36. Decorative and functional borders\n### V37. Which grey carries which text\n### V38. Retuning the token file for a project\n### V39. ALWAYS\n### V40. NEVER\n### V41. ESCALATE IF\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"### V1. Spacing and sizing scale\n### V2. Opacity set\n### V3. Space around a group exceeds space within it\n### V4. Motion duration bands\n### V5. Type scale and units\n### V6. Font weight\n### V7. Line-height and line length\n### V8. Baseline alignment and letter-spacing\n### V9. Line breaking and font synthesis\n### V10. Numerals and typeface selection\n### V11. Personality is four decisions\n### V12. Ramp counts and naming\n### V13. HSL and no runtime shades\n### V14. Build the ramp from 500 outward\n### V15. Saturation rises at the ends\n### V16. Perceived brightness and hue rotation\n### V17. Warm and cool greys\n### V18. Contrast ratios and the two escape hatches\n### V19. Dark mode\n### V20. Five shadow elevations\n### V21. One light source for raised and inset\n### V22. Raised and inset treatments\n### V23. Two-part cast and contact shadows\n### V24. Layered three-part set and pick one\n### V25. Shadow colour\n### V26. Button anatomy\n### V27. Depth without shadows\n### V28. Border radius and concentric radius\n### V29. Semi-transparent borders\n### V30. Grids and fixed sizing\n### V31. Component shape\n### V32. Text over photos\n### V33. Intended size for icons and screenshots\n### V34. User-uploaded content and photography\n### V35. Reference roles, not raw ramps\n### V36. Decorative and functional borders\n### V37. Which grey carries which text\n### V38. Retuning the token file for a project\n### V39. ALWAYS\n### V40. NEVER\n### V41. ESCALATE IF\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals && grep -E \\\"^### V[0-9]+\\\\.\\\" .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-visual-values.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1793873187676,"end":1793873187830}}}}
