{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793873196623,"sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","part":{"partID":"prt_1ab2cb51a001jE4dddrg097uZX","sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","messageID":"msg_1ab2ca96f00139qaiHtubPbRwQ","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-82b694c314c0d3d3","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals && grep -rn \"ignore previous\\|you must now\\|system prompt\\|instruction\" .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-visual-*.md .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md | head"},"output":"(no output)","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"(no output)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals && grep -rn \\\"ignore previous\\\\|you must now\\\\|system prompt\\\\|instruction\\\" .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-visual-*.md .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md | head\"}"},"time":{"start":1793873196314,"end":1793873196623}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793873196627,"sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","part":{"partID":"prt_1ab2cb2660023Jpweu1jd7N4Wx","sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","messageID":"msg_1ab2ca96f00139qaiHtubPbRwQ","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a373996cc0b03aa7","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals && sed -n '/### M33\\./,/### M34\\./p' .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md; echo \"=== absolute paths/urls in new files ===\"; grep -n \"http://\\|https://\\|/Users/\\|file://\" .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-visual-*.md .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/assets/tokens.css | head"},"output":"### M33. Server-side authentication redirect\n\n- **Rule:** Perform authentication redirects on the server before the client loads.\n- **Why:** A client-side check renders protected content for a frame before the redirect, which is a flash of data the user should not see.\n- **When not to:** Handle the redirect on the client when the session expires while the page is already open, since the server is no longer in the loop.\n- **Pitfall:** A client-only guard shows the page shell and its data before the redirect lands.\n- **Support:** Judgment, no version gate.\n- **See also:** [web-performance-and-loading.md](web-performance-and-loading.md).\n\n### M34. Selection styling\n=== absolute paths/urls in new files ===\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"### M33. Server-side authentication redirect\n\n- **Rule:** Perform authentication redirects on the server before the client loads.\n- **Why:** A client-side check renders protected content for a frame before the redirect, which is a flash of data the user should not see.\n- **When not to:** Handle the redirect on the client when the session expires while the page is already open, since the server is no longer in the loop.\n- **Pitfall:** A client-only guard shows the page shell and its data before the redirect lands.\n- **Support:** Judgment, no version gate.\n- **See also:** [web-performance-and-loading.md](web-performance-and-loading.md).\n\n### M34. Selection styling\n=== absolute paths/urls in new files ===\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals && sed -n '/### M33\\\\./,/### M34\\\\./p' .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md; echo \\\"=== absolute paths/urls in new files ===\\\"; grep -n \\\"http://\\\\|https://\\\\|/Users/\\\\|file://\\\" .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-visual-*.md .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/assets/tokens.css | head\"}"},"time":{"start":1793873195622,"end":1793873196627}}}}
