{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793873280147,"sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","part":{"partID":"prt_1ab2dfb65001sAO2dIr9utovZk","sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","messageID":"msg_1ab2df04c001hrUY1a4Q986GM9","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9e069e5a250c38c9","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals && grep -n \"What's New\\|At a Glance\\|radar\\|stacked-area\\|catalog\\|colour\" .skilled/skills/sk-design/sk-design-chart/changelog/v0.23.7.0.md | head -20"},"output":"15:The catalog, colour system, template contract and the evilcharts origin note no longer cite research files or name the phase that made a decision. The decisions stay.\n21:## What's New at a Glance\n23:- **The role split states its own case.** The colour system keeps the standalone categorical gates and their measured hue and contrast figures, without the comparison that produced them.\n25:- **The stacked-area card is one row,** stated as the rule rather than as a correction to an earlier figure.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"15:The catalog, colour system, template contract and the evilcharts origin note no longer cite research files or name the phase that made a decision. The decisions stay.\n21:## What's New at a Glance\n23:- **The role split states its own case.** The colour system keeps the standalone categorical gates and their measured hue and contrast figures, without the comparison that produced them.\n25:- **The stacked-area card is one row,** stated as the rule rather than as a correction to an earlier figure.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals && grep -n \\\"What's New\\\\|At a Glance\\\\|radar\\\\|stacked-area\\\\|catalog\\\\|colour\\\" .skilled/skills/sk-design/sk-design-chart/changelog/v0.23.7.0.md | head -20\"}"},"time":{"start":1793873279845,"end":1793873280147}}}}
