{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793873288851,"sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","part":{"partID":"prt_1ab2e1c98002sMsWJDq9TycQCY","sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","messageID":"msg_1ab2e1293001sZc1f65ONwEJn6","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-90382b5da7549e76","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals && head -30 .skilled/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-figma/changelog/v1.2.2.0.md"},"output":"---\ntitle: \"mcp-figma v1.2.2.0, open values go to sk-code-frontend\"\ndescription: \"v1.2.2.0 sends a frame value that matches no token or scale step to sk-code-frontend's visual-values reference, because the design hub retired its values mode.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"mcp-figma v1.2.2.0\"\n  - \"mcp-figma 1.2.2.0\"\n  - \"open value owner\"\nimportance_tier: \"normal\"\ncontextType: \"general\"\nversion: 1.2.2.0\n---\n\n# v1.2.2.0, Open Values Go to sk-code-frontend\n\nA Figma read that leaves a value open now hands it to `sk-code-frontend` (`web-visual-values.md`). The token-drift and built-screen playbook scenarios name the same owner.\n\n> Spec folder: `specs/sk-design/021-deprecate-fundamentals` (Level 2)\n\n&nbsp;\n\n## Upgrade\n\nNo migration required.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\ntitle: \"mcp-figma v1.2.2.0, open values go to sk-code-frontend\"\ndescription: \"v1.2.2.0 sends a frame value that matches no token or scale step to sk-code-frontend's visual-values reference, because the design hub retired its values mode.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"mcp-figma v1.2.2.0\"\n  - \"mcp-figma 1.2.2.0\"\n  - \"open value owner\"\nimportance_tier: \"normal\"\ncontextType: \"general\"\nversion: 1.2.2.0\n---\n\n# v1.2.2.0, Open Values Go to sk-code-frontend\n\nA Figma read that leaves a value open now hands it to `sk-code-frontend` (`web-visual-values.md`). The token-drift and built-screen playbook scenarios name the same owner.\n\n> Spec folder: `specs/sk-design/021-deprecate-fundamentals` (Level 2)\n\n&nbsp;\n\n## Upgrade\n\nNo migration required.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals && head -30 .skilled/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-figma/changelog/v1.2.2.0.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1793873288344,"end":1793873288851}}}}
