{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793873439134,"sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","part":{"partID":"prt_1ab3061e500207ERDdhwRMklUg","sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","messageID":"msg_1ab305784001DYmX3dHggDJl6i","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a49f2358ab27158b","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport hashlib,re\nfindings=[\n('R1-P1-001','.skilled/skills/sk-code/hub-router.json','90','cross-consumer','The sk-code hub documents \"design review findings\" and \"review this screen\" as frontend visual-intent phrases, but replaying \"design review findings\" and \"design review\" resolves to sk-code-review alone, so web-visual-hierarchy.md is not loaded.'),\n('R1-P2-002','.skilled/skills/sk-design/graph-metadata.json','177-187','instance-only','sk-design graph-metadata.json keeps ten retired fundamentals phrases in derived.intent_signals while the phase summary says they were removed and the top-level intent_signals carries none of them.'),\n('R2-P2-003','specs/sk-design/021-deprecate-fundamentals/002-retire-fundamentals/implementation-summary.md','96','instance-only','The phase 002 implementation summary lists mcp-figma/manual-testing-playbook/figma-to-code/node-to-token-markup.md as modified, but that file is byte-identical to baseline 10474a9567.'),\n('R2-P2-004','specs/sk-design/021-deprecate-fundamentals/001-frontend-upgrade/acceptance-criteria.md','70','instance-only','Phase 001 AC-005 mixes a five-prompt baseline with an eight-prompt replay in one criterion, so its recorded evidence does not identify which prompt set proves the routing claim.'),\n('R3-P2-005','.skilled/skills/sk-code/SKILL.md','44','cross-consumer','The sk-code hub surface table and description.json still describe the frontend surface as web markup, layout, accessibility and Figma only, omitting the three visual references and tokens.css now shipped there.'),\n('R3-P2-006','.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-visual-values.md','247-347','class-of-bug','The retired depth-and-detail shadow-animation technique is absent from web-visual-values.md and web-motion-and-interaction.md, so the phase lost a performance rule it was meant to carry.'),\n('R4-P2-007','.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md','404-410','instance-only','The new motion reference permits a client-side session-expiry redirect without saying the server must still refuse protected data, so a reader can treat a UX redirect as the authorization boundary.'),\n('R5-P2-008','.skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/009-parent-hub-rollout/001-sk-code/fixtures/canary-cases.v1.json','107-129','class-of-bug','The sk-code hub canary never exercises the new code-frontend-visual class, so the visual-review phrase failure is invisible to the compiled-route regression harness.'),\n]\nfor fid,path,lines,cls,claim in findings:\n    desc=re.sub(r'\\s+',' ',claim).strip().lower()[:80]\n    h=hashlib.sha256(f\"{path}\\x1f{lines}\\x1f{cls}\\x1f{desc}\".encode()).hexdigest()\n    print(fid,h)\nEOF"},"output":"R1-P1-001 23af1185fcbdcb2f7d1e2ca463ea69e5365665fd6f59a79425861022e3e9c2ad\nR1-P2-002 cfebd9dfda59726bed4e278b5b55d249cff71ccad406b33ab68715e5a93840bf\nR2-P2-003 f224f90c41a55bfb997376676620438f302c49f5b54a9e9ab65af299c2b0db24\nR2-P2-004 8236940f42c853881a38e329a49219927862d62c9fef256b2ef88ee956593178\nR3-P2-005 8671d8a8a1a7667da53361f26b2d34357f9bdde3fdbe03bc77a8574e1e9c8c22\nR3-P2-006 e236ff2a19125d1e032de03360e381cc41deb2794fcc31c2f517975a698fe1b0\nR4-P2-007 b603c9f11101080b4a4a5f3c445748001bb296825953b85c5b7c9bd06ada3504\nR5-P2-008 b3c9be0279adf87ffeb46c3c322805c0df17ad8056822844dfdeda9e7ec26925\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"R1-P1-001 23af1185fcbdcb2f7d1e2ca463ea69e5365665fd6f59a79425861022e3e9c2ad\nR1-P2-002 