:48\",\"command:compiled-route --hub sk-code --prompt 'design review findings'\",\"command:compiled-route --hub sk-code --prompt 'design review of this pricing page'\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Tried the exact phrase in the frontend ROUTER, the shorter legacy alias, and a phrase that does bundle ('review this screen'); the bundle works only for the phrase that matches no review-class keyword.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The tie-break may intentionally prefer the code-review workflow and expect it to load frontend evidence itself; rejected because the packet contract bundles the surface beside review when the request needs visual review, and the sibling phrase does bundle it.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P1\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade to P2 if sk-code-review is shown to load web-visual-hierarchy.md for every UI review regardless of the hub route.\",\"scopeProof\":\"grep hits the phrase in hub-router.json:90 and sk-code-frontend/ROUTER.md:48; the replay of 'review this screen' returns surfaceBundle [sk-code-review, sk-code-frontend].\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"sk-code hub-router\",\"sk-code-frontend ROUTER\",\"compiled-route\",\"web-visual-hierarchy\"],\"content_hash\":\"23af1185fcbdcb2f7d1e2ca463ea69e5365665fd6f59a79425861022e3e9c2ad\"},{\"id\":\"R1-P2-002\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Graph metadata still advertises the retired values vocabulary\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/sk-design/graph-metadata.json:178\",\"findingClass\":\"instance-only\",\"claim\":\"sk-design graph-metadata.json keeps ten retired fundamentals phrases in derived.intent_signals while the phase summary says they were removed and the top-level intent_signals carries none of them.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-design/graph-metadata.json:177-187\",\".skilled/skills/sk-design/graph-metadata.json:40\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:1358-1366\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Checked every consumer path: the advisor joins top-level intent_signals and derived.trigger_phrases only, so no live route reads derived.intent_signals.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The field may be an authored summary rather than generated state; that still leaves it contradicting the phase summary and the top-level signal set.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":0.95,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"None at P2; it becomes P1 only if a routing consumer starts reading derived.intent_signals.\",\"scopeProof\":\"grep -n over the file finds the ten phrases only inside derived.intent_signals; top-level intent_signals and derived.trigger_phrases contain none of them.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"sk-design graph metadata\",\"advisor metadata consumers\"],\"content_hash\":\"cfebd9dfda59726bed4e278b5b55d249cff71ccad406b33ab68715e5a93840bf\"}],\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"spec_code\":\"partial\",\"checklist_evidence\":\"pending\",\"skill_agent\":\"pass\",\"agent_cross_runtime\":\"pass\"},\"newFindingsRatio\":1.0,\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793872885543-931fzb\",\"generation\":1,\"lineageMode\":\"new\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-05T10:11:06Z\",\"durationMs\":192000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"DIM-correctness\",\"kind\":\"DIMENSION\",\"label\":\"Correctness\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"FILE-hub-router\",\"kind\":\"FILE\",\"label\":\".skilled/skills/sk-code/hub-router.json\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"FILE-graph-metadata\",\"kind\":\"FILE\",\"label\":\".skilled/skills/sk-design/graph-metadata.json\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"FINDING-R1-P1-001\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Visual-review vocabulary miss\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"FINDING-R1-P2-002\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Stale derived intent signals\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"E-R1-1\",\"source\":\"FINDING-R1-P1-001\",\"target\":\"DIM-correctness\",\"relation\":\"IN_DIMENSION\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"E-R1-2\",\"source\":\"FINDING-R1-P1-001\",\"target\":\"FILE-hub-router\",\"relation\":\"IN_FILE\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"E-R1-3\",\"source\":\"FINDING-R1-P2-002\",\"target\":\"DIM-correctness\",\"relation\":\"IN_DIMENSION\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"E-R1-4\",\"source\":\"FINDING-R1-P2-002\",\"target\":\"FILE-graph-metadata\",\"relation\":\"IN_FILE\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"R1-P1-001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"Visual-review vocabulary never reaches the frontend surface\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/sk-code/hub-router.json:90\",\"iteration\":1,\"status\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"cross-consumer\",\"claim\":\"The documented visual-review phrases do not reach sk-code-frontend; replaying 'design review findings' and 'design review of this pricing page' resolves to sk-code-review alone.\",\"recommendation\":\"Add the bare visual-review phrases to code-frontend-visual and make a visual-review request bundle sk-code-frontend beside sk-code-review, then replay the exact phrases.\",\"scopeProof\":\"grep hits the phrase in hub-router.json:90 and sk-code-frontend/ROUTER.md:48; the replay of 'review this screen' returns surfaceBundle [sk-code-review, sk-code-frontend].\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"sk-code hub-router\",\"sk-code-frontend ROUTER\",\"compiled-route\",\"web-visual-hierarchy\"],\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-code/hub-router.json:90\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/ROUTER.md:48\"],\"content_hash\":\"23af1185fcbdcb2f7d1e2ca463ea69e5365665fd6f59a79425861022e3e9c2ad\"}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"R1-P2-002\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Graph metadata still advertises the retired values vocabulary\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/sk-design/graph-metadata.json:178\",\"iteration\":1,\"status\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"instance-only\",\"claim\":\"sk-design graph-metadata.json keeps ten retired fundamentals phrases in derived.intent_signals while the phase summary says they were removed and the top-level intent_signals carries none of them.\",\"recommendation\":\"Rebuild derived.intent_signals from the three surviving modes, or drop the field when no consumer reads it.\",\"scopeProof\":\"grep -n over the file finds the ten phrases only inside derived.intent_signals.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"sk-design graph metadata\",\"advisor metadata consumers\"],\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-design/graph-metadata.json:177-187\"],\"content_hash\":\"cfebd9dfda59726bed4e278b5b55d249cff71ccad406b33ab68715e5a93840bf\"}\n{\"type\":\"classification\",\"detail\":\"Retirement verified on disk and in the compiled sk-design contract: folder absent, three modes, defaultMode null, canaries defer. One routing reach gap remains for visual-review phrases.\",\"iteration\":1}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Leftover live path to the deleted fundamentals folder\",\"reason\":\"repository-wide grep leaves only historical changelogs, the dated benchmark report, retrieval fixtures, and the untracked packet\",\"iteration\":1}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Stale default mode in sk-design\",\"reason\":\"hub-router.json defaultMode is null and compiled replay defers a no-signal prompt\",\"iteration\":1}\n","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals/specs/sk-design/021-deprecate-fundamentals/review/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/sk-design/021-deprecate-fundamentals/review/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-001.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/sk-design/021-deprecate-fundamentals/review/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"mode\\\":\\\"review\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-review\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\\\",\\\"run\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793872885543-931fzb\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"correctness\\\",\\\"dimensions\\\":[\\\"correctness\\\"],\\\"filesReviewed\\\":[\\\"specs/sk-design/021-deprecate-fundamentals/spec.md:101\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-design/mode-registry.json:7\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-design/hub-router.json:5\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-design/ROUTER.md:32\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-design/SKILL.md:54\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-design/graph-metadata.json:178\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/hub-router.json:90\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/ROUTER.md:48\\\",\\\".skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/009-parent-hub-rollout/009-sk-design/lib/registry-compiler.cjs:33\\\",\\\".skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/009-parent-hub-rollout/009-sk-design/fixtures/canary-cases.v1.json:69\\\",\\\".skilled/agents/design.md:70\\\"],\\\"findingsCount\\\":2,\\\"findingsSummary\\\":{\\\"P0\\\":0,\\\"P1\\\":1,\\\"P2\\\":1},\\\"findingsNew\\\":[\\\"R1-P1-001\\\",\\\"R1-P2-002\\\"],\\\"findingDetails\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"R1-P1-001\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Visual-review vocabulary never reaches the frontend surface\\\",\\\"file\\\":\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/hub-router.json:90\\\",\\\"findingClass\\\":\\\"cross-consumer\\\",\\\"claim\\\":\\\"The documented visual-review phrases do not reach sk-code-frontend; replaying 'design review findings' and 'design review of this pricing page' resolves to sk-code-review alone.\\\",\\\"evidenceRefs\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/hub-router.json:90\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/ROUTER.md:48\\\",\\\"command:compiled-route --hub sk-code --prompt 'design review findings'\\\",\\\"command:compiled-route --hub sk-code --prompt 'design review of this pricing page'\\\"],\\\"counterevidenceSought\\\":\\\"Tried the exact phrase in the frontend ROUTER, the shorter legacy alias, and a phrase that does bundle ('review this screen'); the bundle works only for the phrase that matches no review-class keyword.\\\",\\\"alternativeExplanation\\\":\\\"The tie-break may intentionally prefer the code-review workflow and expect it to load frontend evidence itself; rejected because the packet contract bundles the surface beside review when the request needs visual review, and the sibling phrase does bundle it.\\\",\\\"finalSeverity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"downgradeTrigger\\\":\\\"Downgrade to P2 if sk-code-review is shown to load web-visual-hierarchy.md for every UI review regardless of the hub route.\\\",\\\"scopeProof\\\":\\\"grep hits the phrase in hub-router.json:90 and sk-code-frontend/ROUTER.md:48; the replay of 'review this screen' returns surfaceBundle [sk-code-review, sk-code-frontend].\\\",\\\"affectedSurfaceHints\\\":[\\\"sk-code hub-router\\\",\\\"sk-code-frontend ROUTER\\\",\\\"compiled-route\\\",\\\"web-visual-hierarchy\\\"],\\\"content_hash\\\":\\\"23af1185fcbdcb2f7d1e2ca463ea69e5365665fd6f59a79425861022e3e9c2ad\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"R1-P2-002\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Graph metadata still advertises the retired values vocabulary\\\",\\\"file\\\":\\\".skilled/skills/sk-design/graph-metadata.json:178\\\",\\\"findingClass\\\":\\\"instance-only\\\",\\\"claim\\\":\\\"sk-design graph-metadata.json keeps ten retired fundamentals phrases in derived.intent_signals while the phase summary says they were removed and the top-level intent_signals carries none of them.\\\",\\\"evidenceRefs\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-design/graph-metadata.json:177-187\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-design/graph-metadata.json:40\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:1358-1366\\\"],\\\"counterevidenceSought\\\":\\\"Checked every consumer path: the advisor joins top-level intent_signals and derived.trigger_phrases only, so no live route reads derived.intent_signals.\\\",\\\"alternativeExplanation\\\":\\\"The field may be an authored summary rather than generated state; that still leaves it contradicting the phase summary and the top-level signal set.\\\",\\\"finalSeverity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"confidence\\\":0.95,\\\"downgradeTrigger\\\":\\\"None at P2; it becomes P1 only if a routing consumer starts reading derived.intent_signals.\\\",\\\"scopeProof\\\":\\\"grep -n over the file finds the ten phrases only inside derived.intent_signals; top-level intent_signals and derived.trigger_phrases contain none of them.\\\",\\\"affectedSurfaceHints\\\":[\\\"sk-design graph metadata\\\",\\\"advisor metadata consumers\\\"],\\\"content_hash\\\":\\\"cfebd9dfda59726bed4e278b5b55d249cff71ccad406b33ab68715e5a93840bf\\\"}],\\\"traceabilityChecks\\\":{\\\"spec_code\\\":\\\"partial\\\",\\\"checklist_evidence\\\":\\\"pending\\\",\\\"skill_agent\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"agent_cross_runtime\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},\\\"newFindingsRatio\\\":1.0,\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793872885543-931fzb\\\",\\\"generation\\\":1,\\\"lineageMode\\\":\\\"new\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-05T10:11:06Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":192000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"DIM-correctness\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"DIMENSION\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Correctness\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"FILE-hub-router\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FILE\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/hub-router.json\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"FILE-graph-metadata\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FILE\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\".skilled/skills/sk-design/graph-metadata.json\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"FINDING-R1-P1-001\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Visual-review vocabulary miss\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"FINDING-R1-P2-002\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Stale derived intent signals\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"E-R1-1\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"FINDING-R1-P1-001\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"DIM-correctness\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"IN_DIMENSION\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"E-R1-2\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"FINDING-R1-P1-001\\\",\\\"target\\\