{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793873589502,"sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","part":{"partID":"prt_1ab32999e001ff5kx7b0vdG98M","sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","messageID":"msg_1ab3290f4001ywIK121gV7AZGF","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b7849626605b985f","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"mode\":\"review\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-review\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\"run\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793872885543-931fzb\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"maintainability\",\"dimensions\":[\"maintainability\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-code/SKILL.md:44\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/SKILL.md:50\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/SKILL.md:115\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/description.json:3\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/description.json:40\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/SKILL.md:30\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/README.md:51\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/ROUTER.md:23\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-visual-values.md:247\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md:300\",\".skilled/skills/sk-design/SKILL.md:54\",\".skilled/skills/sk-design/benchmark/README.md:33\"],\"findingsCount\":2,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":0,\"P2\":2},\"findingsNew\":[\"R3-P2-005\",\"R3-P2-006\"],\"findingDetails\":[{\"id\":\"R3-P2-005\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Hub canonical surface description still omits the three visual references\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/sk-code/SKILL.md:44\",\"findingClass\":\"cross-consumer\",\"claim\":\"The sk-code surface table, surface list and layout comment describe the frontend surface without the three visual references or tokens.css, and description.json keeps the old 'web and Figma-to-code' wording and a 2026-10-10 lastUpdated.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-code/SKILL.md:44\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/SKILL.md:50\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/SKILL.md:115\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/description.json:3\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/description.json:40\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Checked the surface README, surface SKILL and agent capability table, which all name the new files; the omission is confined to the hub's canonical description family.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The hub table may deliberately stay coarse; but it already enumerates the surface's domains, so leaving out the new ones makes the enumeration wrong rather than coarse.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":0.95,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"None at P2.\",\"scopeProof\":\"grep for web-visual-values in sk-code/SKILL.md prints no line; the surface README and surface SKILL both name the file.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"sk-code SKILL\",\"sk-code description.json\",\"surface discovery\"],\"content_hash\":\"8671d8a8a1a7667da53361f26b2d34357f9bdde3fdbe03bc77a8574e1e9c8c22\"},{\"id\":\"R3-P2-006\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Shadow-animation performance rule did not move with the depth guidance\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-visual-values.md:247\",\"findingClass\":\"class-of-bug\",\"claim\":\"The retired depth-and-detail rule that avoids transitioning box-shadow by animating a pseudo-element's opacity is absent from both new shadow and motion references.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-visual-values.md:247\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md:300\",\"baseline:10474a9567:.skilled/skills/sk-design/sk-design-fundamentals/references/depth-and-detail.md\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Mapped every heading in the nine retired references to a new V/H/M item; this is the only retired section with no successor. Checked M27 and M29 for the same rule; they cover blur repaint and GPU promotion, not shadow transitions.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The consolidation may have decided the technique was too implementation-specific; the packet's own decision table only drops slides and print, so no recorded decision covers this loss.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":0.85,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade if a project token file or the existing web-performance-and-loading.md already carries the pseudo-element technique; it does not.\",\"scopeProof\":\"grep for pseudo-element in the two new files hits only the touch-target M9 rule, not shadow animation; the old section has no successor.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"web-visual-values elevation\",\"web-motion-and-interaction performance\",\"tokens.css shadow set\"],\"content_hash\":\"6f8eb7afe6e7c8a4a602bcced33091429e8ca128fbd3b5b97aed2f9ed413c148\"}],\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"spec_code\":\"partial\",\"checklist_evidence\":\"partial\",\"skill_agent\":\"pass\",\"agent_cross_runtime\":\"pass\"},\"newFindingsRatio\":1.0,\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793872885543-931fzb\",\"generation\":1,\"lineageMode\":\"new\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-05T10:12:59Z\",\"durationMs\":126000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"DIM-maintainability\",\"kind\":\"DIMENSION\",\"label\":\"Maintainability\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"FILE-sk-code-skill\",\"kind\":\"FILE\",\"label\":\".skilled/skills/sk-code/SKILL.md\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"FILE-visual-values\",\"kind\":\"FILE\",\"label\":\"web-visual-values.md\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"FINDING-R3-P2-005\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Hub surface description omission\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"FINDING-R3-P2-006\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Lost shadow animation rule\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"E-R3-1\",\"source\":\"FINDING-R3-P2-005\",\"target\":\"DIM-maintainability\",\"relation\":\"IN_DIMENSION\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"E-R3-2\",\"source\":\"FINDING-R3-P2-005\",\"target\":\"FILE-sk-code-skill\",\"relation\":\"IN_FILE\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"E-R3-3\",\"source\":\"FINDIN