zation boundary.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md:361-369\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Searched the three new references for any other authentication or authorization statement; M33 is the only one, and its own Why states the flash-of-data risk it then re-permits.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"A reader may assume server authorization is unchanged; the item does not say so, and the 'server is no longer in the loop' wording actively suggests otherwise.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":0.8,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade if web-performance-and-loading.md or the surface's workflow docs already state the server-side refusal requirement for the same case.\",\"scopeProof\":\"grep for auth in the three new references returns only M33; no adjacent item covers session expiry.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"web-motion-and-interaction M33\",\"auth redirect guidance\",\"session expiry\"],\"content_hash\":\"29940fe8d9d3c759840c38b9be0b94f9b7ab98e75e38ab716b9883c2753af2b7\"}],\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"spec_code\":\"partial\",\"checklist_evidence\":\"partial\",\"skill_agent\":\"pass\",\"agent_cross_runtime\":\"pass\",\"feature_catalog_code\":\"notApplicable\",\"playbook_capability\":\"pass\"},\"newFindingsRatio\":1.0,\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793872885543-931fzb\",\"generation\":1,\"lineageMode\":\"new\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-05T10:13:40Z\",\"durationMs\":114000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"DIM-security\",\"kind\":\"DIMENSION\",\"label\":\"Security\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"FILE-motion\",\"kind\":\"FILE\",\"label\":\"web-motion-and-interaction.md\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"FINDING-R4-P2-007\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Session-expiry redirect wording\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"E-R4-1\",\"source\":\"FINDING-R4-P2-007\",\"target\":\"DIM-security\",\"relation\":\"IN_DIMENSION\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"E-R4-2\",\"source\":\"FINDING-R4-P2-007\",\"target\":\