2\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Session-expiry exception can be read as client-side authorization\\\",\\\"file\\\":\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md:361\\\",\\\"findingClass\\\":\\\"instance-only\\\",\\\"claim\\\":\\\"M33 permits a client-side redirect when a session expires while the page is open and never says data calls must still be refused server-side, so a reader can treat the UX redirect as the authorization boundary.\\\",\\\"evidenceRefs\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md:361-369\\\"],\\\"counterevidenceSought\\\":\\\"Searched the three new references for any other authentication or authorization statement; M33 is the only one, and its own Why states the flash-of-data risk it then re-permits.\\\",\\\"alternativeExplanation\\\":\\\"A reader may assume server authorization is unchanged; the item does not say so, and the 'server is no longer in the loop' wording actively suggests otherwise.\\\",\\\"finalSeverity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"confidence\\\":0.8,\\\"downgradeTrigger\\\":\\\"Downgrade if web-performance-and-loading.md or the surface's workflow docs already state the server-side refusal requirement for the same case.\\\",\\\"scopeProof\\\":\\\"grep for auth in the three new references returns only M33; no adjacent item covers session expiry.\\\",\\\"affectedSurfaceHints\\\":[\\\"web-motion-and-interaction M33\\\",\\\"auth redirect guidance\\\",\\\"session expiry\\\"],\\\"content_hash\\\":\\\"29940fe8d9d3c759840c38b9be0b94f9b7ab98e75e38ab716b9883c2753af2b7\\\"}],\\\"traceabilityChecks\\\":{\\\"spec_code\\\":\\\"partial\\\",\\\"checklist_evidence\\\":\\\"partial\\\",\\\"skill_agent\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"agent_cross_runtime\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"feature_catalog_code\\\":\\\"notApplicable\\\",\\\"playbook_capability\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},\\\"newFindingsRatio\\\":1.0,\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793872885543-931fzb\\\",\\\"generation\\\":1,\\\"lineageMode\\\":\\\"new\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-05T10:13:40Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":114000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"DIM-security\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"DIMENSION\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Security\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"FILE-motion\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FILE\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"web-motion-and-interaction.md\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"FINDING-R4-P2-007\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Session-expiry redirect wording\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"E-R4-1\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"FINDING-R4-P2-007\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"DIM-security\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"IN_DIMENSION\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"E-R4-2\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"FINDING-R4-P2-007\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"FILE-motion\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"IN_FILE\\\"}]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"R4-P2-007\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Session-expiry exception can be read as client-side authorization\\\",\\\"file\\\":\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md:361\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"findingClass\\\":\\\"instance-only\\\",\\\"claim\\\":\\\"M33 permits a client-side redirect when a session expires while the page is open and never says data calls must still be refused server-side, so a reader can treat the UX redirect as the authorization boundary.\\\",\\\"recommendation\\\":\\\"State that the client redirect is a UX redirect only, that data requests are still refused server-side, and that cached protected data is cleared before redirecting.\\\",\\\"scopeProof\\\":\\\"grep for auth in the three new references returns only M33; no adjacent item covers session expiry.\\\",\\\"affectedSurfaceHints\\\":[\\\"web-motion-and-interaction M33\\\",\\\"auth redirect guidance\\\",\\\"session expiry\\\"],\\\"evidenceRefs\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-motion-and-interaction.md:361-369\\\"],\\\"content_hash\\\":\\\"29940fe8d9d3c759840c38b9be0b94f9b7ab98e75e38ab716b9883c2753af2b7\\\"}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"classification\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"The change set introduces no secret, path escape, executable instruction or URL. The only security-relevant document defect is the session-expiry exception in M33.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Secret embedded in tokens.css\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"scan finds HSL values, comments and custom properties only\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Manifest path traversal\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"JSON string scan finds no absolute path or .. segment; the one leading slash is the /design:diagram command key\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Prompt-injection directive in the reviewed docs\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"directive scan returns no hit in the new references or chart files\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4}\\n\", \"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals/specs/sk-design/021-deprecate-fundamentals/review/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1793873623295,"end":1793873627840}}}}
