{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793873758269,"sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","part":{"partID":"prt_1ab35437d001NDWGn3MRBtwexB","sessionID":"ses_e54d7f46fffe0ZLISbmnuV6zfy","messageID":"msg_1ab353ae3001TCuPjlYqCKIrus","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-adad975561ae8e3c","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"## 11A. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n- **Live path to the deleted folder:** repository-wide grep leaves only historical changelogs, the\n  dated benchmark report, retrieval fixtures and the untracked packet (iteration 1).\n- **Stale default mode:** `hub-router.json` sets `defaultMode: null` and the compiled replay\n  defers a no-signal prompt (iteration 1).\n- **Wholesale false changed-file table:** one false row across three summaries (iteration 2).\n- **Wholesale loss of the retired references:** eight of nine retired references have complete\n  successors (iteration 3).\n- **Secret, path traversal or prompt injection in the new files:** the three scans are clean\n  (iteration 4).\n- **A second active P1 in the load-set or canary gaps:** both are coverage mismatches with no\n  wrong route beyond R1-P1-001 (iteration 5).","oldString":"## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Review angles that were investigated and definitively eliminated -- consolidated from iteration dead-end data]","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/316-deprecate-design-fundamentals/specs/sk-design/021-deprecate-fundamentals/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/sk-design/021-deprecate-fundamentals/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/sk-design/021-deprecate-fundamentals/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/sk-design/021-deprecate-fundamentals/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/sk-design/021-deprecate